務的（敬語など）ですが、テキスト内にハートマークを適度に散らして、えっちな雰囲気にしていただきたいです。\n\n・アナル舐め手コキなど、逃げ場のないようなねちっこくて執拗な「童貞には刺激が強すぎるメニュー」をお願いします。\n\n\n初めてのSkeb依頼のため、至らぬ点があるかもしれませんが、先生の解釈で自由に筆を振るっていただければと思います。\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 184, "word_count": 14770, "transcoder": "text", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 221875, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぉ〜たらん_skeb募集中！", "screen_name": "caution_____", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1160361293196357632/J34akHhw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/934741800165584897/1575110258/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 299245, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いかじゅん", "screen_name": "731_hayato", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1670275652971565057/5f0OzSII.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/890782106/1574617836/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 80, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 185}, {"id": 311894, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ゆきのじょう！", "screen_name": "yukinojou0xCD", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1824332646165647360/kTeA0i94.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "complete_expiration_days": 